+	# [MP8] 🩸 T44 item 0 (root cause) - the gate must be re-evaluated when someone disconnects.
+	#
+	# In a nutshell, the check at `minigame.gd:132`
+	# `players_loaded.size() == PlayerManager.player_presences.size()`
+	# **is only evaluated at the moment someone reports in**, while a disconnect shrinks the denominator
